  "notes": [
    "Preregistered validation: unit-test exact/bounded deterministic EV and skip conditions; smoke must have positive allin_ev_replacements, finite losses, exact hand/assignment accounting, no KL stop, and unchanged deployment architecture. Only then run a 262,144 actual-hand treatment with seed 20260852/worker seed 2026085200 and the untouched seed20260853 four-checkpoint matched curve. Promote to Slumbot only on consistent robust paired multi-anchor evidence.",
    "Initial pytest collection exposed only a new-test import-path error before any EV logic ran; corrected the test import. The exact preregistered suite then passed 9/9, covering deterministic bounded sampling, exhaustive equity reward, zero-sum player perspectives, runout cap, and all skip conditions.",
    "Smoke gate PASS at 4,111 actual hands: 16 qualifying all-ins were replaced using 2,108 deterministic runouts (131.75 mean), zero skipped, finite losses, reference KL 0.0001304, zero KL stops, and fail-closed fixed-pool session audit PASS.",
    "Added a separate immutable-log audit rather than modifying the fixed-pool auditor already hash-locked by a completed experiment. Smoke EV log audit PASS and proves the registered EV intervention activated while mirror-deal variance reduction remained off.",
    "Production completed normally at 263,472 actual hands. Both terminal audits PASS. EV activated in all 64 updates: 1,698 payoff replacements and 212,148 runouts (124.94 mean), zero skipped, mirror intervention remained off; session assignment/hash/optimizer/archive integrity is complete.",
    "Fresh matched frozen curve had zero OOD and 5 positive versus 7 negative paired rows. Mean delta +0.5761 was driven by high-variance late CFR96 rows; median was -0.1675, slumbot_free was negative at all checkpoints, and every 95% CI crossed zero. Robust gate failed; no Slumbot evaluation."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "All-in runout EV was active, stable, and fully auditable across 267,583 new training hands, but it failed the untouched matched generalization gate.",
    "conclusion": "Across four frozen checkpoints and three anchors, paired deltas had 5 positive and 7 negative estimates; mean +0.5761 but median -0.1675 bb/100, with every 95% CI crossing zero. Late CFR96 gains were too noisy, slumbot_free was negative throughout, and terminal Standard10 still had a negative lower bound.",
    "decision": "REJECT_ALLIN_EV_SCALE_NO_ROBUST_GENERAL_GAIN",
    "next_step": "Retain runout EV as a sound optional variance-reduction primitive, but do not deepen it alone or run Slumbot. Target a broader return-variance or counterfactual learning intervention with a distinct causal smoke/control."
  },
